input_ime with `autocmd` in Neovide.\n4. Remap `shift` (optional).\n- For all keyboard: rema"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"p `space` to `shift` by karabiner.\n> The original tap and hold (repeat) functions of `space` are sti"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"`shift` by karabiner.\n> The original tap and hold (repeat) functions of `space` are still available."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## IdeaVim"},{"id":"p15s1","text":".ideavimrc"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## VSCode Neovim"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"settings.json"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"keybindings.json"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Doom Emacs"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"DOOMDIR"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Using Emacs Plus."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Fish"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"fish config"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"TODO:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- [ ] Try nushell."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Oh my tmux!"},{"id":"p27s1","text":".tmux.conf.local"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"TODO:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- [ ] Try zellij."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Yazi"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"yazi config"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## RIME"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"My rime config for Chinese input based on TigerCode."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Using InputSourcePro to keep Squirrel as the only input source on macOS, instead of ABC."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"And using ShowyEdge to notice when input source automatically changes to ABC."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Using emacs-rime in Doom Emacs and rime-ls in Neovim."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## SketchyBar"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"sketchybarrc"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## yabai"},{"id":"p40s1","text":".yabairc"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"TODO:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- [ ] Try AeroSpace.\n- [ ] Try acsandmann/rift.\n- [ ] Try karinushka/paneru."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## zathura"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"zathurarc"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"Using zathura-pdf-poppler plugin."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Fix zathura auto focus on open problem by using yabai."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
